<runspec version="MOVES5.0.1">
	<description><![CDATA[County-domain (SINGLE) inventory for Washtenaw with TIME AGGREGATION by year,
every process: <aggregateBy key="Year"/> collapses the hours (PreAggDAY.sql),
the day types (PreAggMONTH.sql) and the months (PreAggYEAR.sql: MonthOfAnyYear
0, ZoneMonthHour by MonthWeighting, FuelSupply as a SUM by MonthGroupWeighting,
AverageTankTemperature and SoakActivityFraction summed -- both still empty when
it runs, no generator has written them) before any generator runs, and
<outputtimestep value="Year"/>. January, April, July and October 2020, both
day types, all 24 hours. Selections as scale-county-timeagg-processes-month:
the evaporative processes (permeation, vapor venting, leaks) and refueling
(displacement, spillage) beside the exhaust, crankcase and wear processes.
County database county-inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg/setup-timeagg.sql.]]></description>
